<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for Jan 27 to Feb 2 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		 Jan 27-Feb 2  Jan 29-Feb 4     TOTAL	 TOTAL</p>
<p>		  1996/97	 1995/96	 1996/97     1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    529,862.3    521,265.3</p>
<p> Production	11,639.5    27,194.6  1,079,487.1   925,682.8</p>
<p> Shipment	  41,862.4    15,452.4    739,655.3   562,165.0</p>
<p> Home Market	  424.8	 285.3     10,065.0    11,845.7</p>
<p> Stocks/close   499,214.6    532,722.2</p>
<p>--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417</p>
</text>
